# NOTICE — third-party corpora used by 04-data-cleaning-dedup

This exercise reads three public datasets and republishes, on its page, aggregate statistics plus a
small bounded window of post-scrub excerpts. Two of the three licences require attribution, and
this file is that attribution.

No personal information is republished. Interactive demonstrations on the page and in the notebook
run on a hand-written synthetic document whose identifiers use RFC 2606 reserved domains and the
RFC 5737 documentation IP range, so they belong to nobody. Where corpus text appears at all it has
already passed the PII scrubber, and a test scans every published byte to keep it that way.

