## Also used

- **FLORES-200** (Meta AI, CC-BY-SA-4.0) — parallel evaluation text, via exercise 03, for grading
  language identification and measuring tokenizer fertility. Not part of the training corpus.
- **Our own Exercise 02 tokenizer**, `src/exercises/02-tokenization/web/tokenizer.json`, produced in
